  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - This proposal CONSTITUTES DEVELOPMENT within the meaning of Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, and a planning application IS REQUIRED. \r\n\r\nThe proposed roof extensions would create additional cubic content which would exceed 40 cubic metres for the terraced house and would thereby fail to comply with Class B. B.1 (d)(i)\r\nof Schedule 2, Part 1, of the Town & Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015. Planning permission would therefore be required.\r\n"
